name: morning-brief
description: "Daily 7AM briefing — news, tasks, system health, AI action recs"
cron: "0 7 * * *"
timezone: "America/New_York"
steps:
  - tool: web_fetch
    label: weather
    input:
      url: "https://wttr.in/?format=3"
  - tool: web_fetch
    label: hn-top
    input:
      url: "https://hacker-news.firebaseio.com/v0/topstories.json"
  - tool: sessions_send
    label: compose-brief
    input:
      agentId: legacy
      message: |
        MORNING BRIEF — compile and DM Zeus (1024395579742228570) via Discord DM.

        Data:
        - Weather: {{weather.output}}
        - HN top ID list: {{hn-top.output}}

        Build this brief and DM it:
        =============================
        MORNING BRIEF — {today}

        WEATHER: {weather one-liner}

        TECH PULSE (fetch titles for top 5 HN IDs from the list above using
        https://hacker-news.firebaseio.com/v0/item/ID.json, pick highest-scored):
        1. [title] — score X
        2. [title] — score X
        3. [title] — score X

        TASKS TODAY: Check Todoist API (TODOIST_API_KEY env var) for tasks
        due today or priority 1. List up to 5.

        AI ACTIONS I'LL TAKE TODAY: Proactively list 2-3 things you can handle
        autonomously for Zeus (research, draft, monitor, build). Be specific.

        SYSTEM: Any docker container issues from last health-check?
        =============================
        Keep total message under 400 words. Friendly but efficient tone.
